,{"id":2578858,"name":"Holger Dudla","role":"Giant"},{"id":2578859,"name":"Adolf Kraus","role":"Giant"},{"id":2578860,"name":"Karl Krebs","role":"Giant"},{"id":2578861,"name":"Andrea Kobusch","role":"Giant"},{"id":2578862,"name":"Radu Mendrea","role":"Giant"},{"id":2578863,"name":"Jan Berghout","role":"Giant"},{"id":2578864,"name":"Axel Münderlein","role":"Giant"},{"id":1279033,"name":"Robert Naegele","role":"Giant","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qMyAK4JnUSMWx2ocFcF4i7elN4y.jpg"},{"id":2578865,"name":"Christian Reuter","role":"Giant"},{"id":2578866,"name":"Jochen Reuter","role":"Giant"},{"id":2578868,"name":"Oliver Ritzinger","role":"Giant"},{"id":2578869,"name":"Peter Rossmeisel","role":"Giant"},{"id":2465752,"name":"Markus Rupprecht","role":"Giant"},{"id":2578870,"name":"Peter Sassmann","role":"Giant"},{"id":2578871,"name":"Stefan Schwankner","role":"Giant"},{"id":2578872,"name":"Heinz Siegel","role":"Giant"},{"id":57687,"name":"Donald Arthur","role":"Falkor (voice) (uncredited)"},{"id":84012,"name":"Andreas Beckett","role":"City Dweller (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yjNZohwfKPQ5HmpvmltU1rlRNhE.jpg"},{"id":83089,"name":"Joe Milner","role":"The Balladeer (voice) (uncredited)"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"La storia infinita 2","overview":"Il regno di Fantasia sta per essere distrutto dal potere del Nulla, tra le pagine del libro \"La storia infinita\", che il piccolo Sebastian, orfano di madre e incompreso dal padre, si mette a leggere nella soffitta di casa per sottrarsi alla realtà che lo rende infelice. Mentre è intento alla lettura, viene risucchiato dalle vicende che sta immaginando. Insieme al fido Atreyu e al drago volante Falkor, Sebastian sconfigge la bellissima ma perfida regina Xayide."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The NeverEnding Story II: The Next Chapter","overview":"Once again, Bastian is transported to the world of Fantasia which he recently managed to save from destruction. However, the land is now being destroyed by an evil sorceress, Xayide, so he must join up with Atreyu and face the Emptiness once more.","tagline":"Begin an all new adventure as a young boy returns to a world of wonder on the wings of his imagination."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Kein Buch bleibt sich gleich, wenn man es zum zweiten Mal liest. Bastian, ein Junge mit zuwenig Selbstvertrauen, muss das selbst erfahren, als er sich wieder auf das Leseabenteuer mit \"Die unendliche Geschichte\" einlässt. Bastian taucht ein in das Buch und wird diesmal selbst von ihm nach Phantàsien getragen, dem Ort aller Geschichten und Träume, die die Menschen zum Leben so nötig haben. Doch das Reich der Phantasie, in dem die kindliche Kaiserin herrscht, wird von der Herrin über die große Leere, der verführerischen Xayide, tödlich bedroht. Bastian das Menschenkind, und sein treuer Freund Atreju aus Phantàsien müssen viele gefährliche Abenteuer durchleben, bevor sie in letzter Sekunde Phantasien, und damit auch den Weitergang der \"unendlichen Geschichte\", retten können."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7baJFEwnxVAh1ktIyMDHJnyTAFl.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/22328gc644F4pZn30nWPPUo4I93.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":34636,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7baJFEwnxVAh1ktIyMDHJnyTAFl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7baJFEwnxVAh1ktIyMDHJnyTAFl.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7baJFEwnxVAh1ktIyMDHJnyTAFl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7baJFEwnxVAh1ktIyMDHJnyTAFl.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster",